4. Inspect the existing `design-system/MASTER.md` if it exists.
5. Run or invoke the relevant UI UX Pro Max workflow for the remediation task.
6. Update the design system rather than creating one-off CSS fixes.

The agent MUST NOT "patch until it looks okay".

The agent MUST first identify the root design-system causes.

